## Interface: 120100
## Title: XayaUI Debug
## Notes: XayaUI's debug tools: the console window (/xui console), the bug report (/xui bug) and the debug report (/xui report). XayaUI loads them once per login or /reload, only while Settings > Debugging > Advanced Debugging is on (off by default), so they cost nothing otherwise.
## Author: Xaya
## Version: 0.7.0
## X-Date: 2026-11-12
## Dependencies: XayaUI
## OptionalDeps: XayaUI_Rules
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## Group: XayaUI

Tools.lua
Console.lua
BugReport.lua
DebugReport.lua
# XayaUI Rules' debug pieces (the engine perf report, /xui auras, /xuiengine, /xui status) are appended below this line. Each registers
# through Modules.lua (ns.RegisterDebugCommand, ns.RegisterCommand) and reads XayaUI Rules only through what it publishes; XayaUI Rules
# loads first when it is on (## OptionalDeps above). Tools.lua says how core gates them.
